cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the CUHK-X dataset paper (see README)."
title: "MiyakoHAR: cross-subject human activity recognition from depth, infrared and thermal video"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-16
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/KUAS-ubicomp-lab/MiyakoHAR"
abstract: >-
  Team MiyakoHAR's solution to the CUHK-X 2026 Multimodal Human Activity Challenge,
  Small Model Track: two channel-separated 3D convolutional networks (ir-CSN-R50 on the
  depth and infrared streams, ir-CSN-152 on the thermal stream) fused at the probability
  level and packaged in one 83.6 MB file. Private leaderboard score 0.78921, 39th of 326 teams.
