    affiliation: "Ubiquitous and Personal Computing Lab, Kyoto University of Advanced Science"
  - family-names: Liang
    given-names: Zilu
    affiliation: "Ubiquitous and Personal Computing Lab, Kyoto University of Advanced Science"
keywords:
  - human activity recognition
  - cross-subject
  - depth video
  - thermal imaging
  - channel-separated convolutional networks
  - CUHK-X
